<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Akses Ditolak</title>

<style>
  body{
    margin:0;
    height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #0f172a, #020617);
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial;
    color:#e2e8f0;
  }

  .card{
    width:460px;
    padding:42px;
    border-radius:16px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
    border:1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    text-align:center;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .icon{
    font-size:64px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }

  h1{
    font-size:26px;
    margin:10px 0;
    font-weight:700;
  }

  p{
    font-size:14px;
    color:#94a3b8;
    line-height:1.6;
    margin-bottom:25px;
  }

  .badge{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:6px 12px;
    border-radius:999px;
    font-size:12px;
    background:#1e293b;
    border:1px solid #334155;
    color:#cbd5e1;
    margin-bottom:15px;
  }

  .btn{
    display:block;
    padding:12px;
    margin-top:12px;
    border-radius:10px;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-weight:600;
    transition:0.3s;
  }

  .btn-home{
    background:#e2e8f0;
    color:#0f172a;
  }

  .btn-home:hover{
    background:#ffffff;
  }

  .btn-wa{
    background:#16a34a;
    color:white;
  }

  .btn-wa:hover{
    background:#15803d;
  }

  .footer{
    margin-top:18px;
    font-size:11px;
    color:#64748b;
  }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

  <div class="icon">⛔</div>

  <div class="badge">ACCESS DENIED</div>

  <h1>Akses Ditolak</h1>

  <p>
    Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk mengakses halaman ini.<br/>
    Sistem telah mendeteksi bahwa role Anda tidak sesuai dengan otorisasi yang dibutuhkan.
  </p>

  <a href="/" class="btn btn-home">Kembali ke Login</a>

  <div class="footer">
    SIGAP Kerja • Security & Operational Control System
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
